ittings to provide residents with the best living experience.\n\n​\n\nWorld-Class Amenities: ASMI Legacy boasts a range of amenities including a fully equipped gym, landscaped garden, children’s play area, and 24/7 security to ensure a safe and enjoyable lifestyle for all residents.\n\n​ [...] ​\n\nIdeal for Families: Whether you’re looking for a cozy 2 BHK or a spacious 3 OR 4 BHK, ASMI Legacy caters to all family sizes and needs, offering a blend of luxury and practicality.\n\n​​\n\n### Why Choose ASMI Legacy?\n\n### ​\n\nUnbeatable Location: Located in Goregaon West, near SV Road and close to Jawahar Nagar, this project offers quick access to all major parts of Mumbai. Schools like Vibgyor High, hospitals, and malls like Oberoi Mall are just minutes away.\n\n​\n\nInvestment Opportunity: Goregaon West is one of the most sought-after residential areas in Mumbai, making ASMI Legacy not just a home but a great investment for the future.\n\n## AMENITIES: ASMI DEVELOPERS ASMI LEGACY . UNNAT NAGAR . JAWAHAR NAGAR . GOREGAON WEST","score":0.8458536,"raw_content":null,"id":"183ef6-02"},{"url":"https://www.nobroker.in/asmi-legacy-goregaon-west_mumbai-prjt-8a9f9083965b73e301965bc091c811aa","title":"ASMI Legacy Goregaon West: Price, Photos & Floor Plans","content":"## Overview of ASMI Legacy\n\nTotal Area: 1.50 Acres\n\nTowers: 2 Towers\n\nUnits: 110 Units\n\nConfiguration: 2 BHK and 3 BHK\n\nStoreys: G + 5P + 35 Floors\n\nPossession Date: June 2027\n\nLandmark: Ration Office\n\nDeveloper: ASMI Developers\n\nAddress: 20, Unnat Nagar Rd Number 1, Yashwant Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400104\n\nGoogle Map: ASMI Legacy Location\n\nAmenity: ASMI Legacy is thoughtfully designed to enhance every aspect of your lifestyle. Stay active with a fully equipped gym, yoga area, walking track, and skating rink. Kids have their play zone, while seniors can relax in a dedicated area. The project also features lush lawns, a creche, a reflexology path, indoor games, and a cosy rea