rain board\n\n## Asmi Legacy Walkthrough Video\n\n## Asmi Legacy Location [...] The project includes over 25 amenities such as a Gym, Yoga Zone, Crèche, Gaming Lounge, Indoor Games, Kids Play Area, Skating Rink, Reflexology Path, Senior Citizen Space, Reading Corner, Tranquility Garden and more.\n\nLocated Nearby SV & MG Road - 1 Mins, Goregaon Station - 4 Mins, Metro (Pahadi) - 8 Mins, Western Express Highway - 10 Mins, Airport - 20 Mins, the property offers excellent connectivity.\n\nYes, Asmi Legacy is an RERA-authorized project with MahaRERA number P51800031746.\n\n## Asmi Legacy MAHARASHTRA RERA Details\n\nNo documents available.\n\n## Get In Touch\n\n## Latest Projects in Goregaon West\n\nAxiom Rudra   Sahakar Ved   Hrishabraj Arham   OM Manikanta\n\n## Share this Project:","score":0.81875163,"raw_content":null,"id":"724f49-05"},{"url":"https://www.thexclusiveproject.com/properties/asmi-legacy-goregaon-west","title":"ASMI LEGACY GOREGAON WEST","content":"Spacious Layouts: The project offers luxurious 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and 4 BHK (JODI) apartments, crafted with attention to detail, ensuring ample space, natural light, and ventilation.  \n  \nModern Amenities: Residents can enjoy a range of amenities such as a fully-equipped gymnasium, children’s play area, landscaped gardens, and 24/7 security, providing a safe and vibrant community living experience.  \n  \nExcellent Connectivity: ASMI Legacy is well-connected to SV Road, Link Road, and the Western Express Highway, offering seamless access to key areas like Andheri, Malad, and Borivali. The nearby Goregaon Railway Station and upcoming metro stations further enhance connectivity. [...] High-Speed Elevators – ASMI Legacy offers fast and efficient high-speed elevators for convenience.  \n  \nRainwater Harvesting – Environment-friendly rainwater harvesting systems installed for sustainable living.  \n  \nVastu-Compliant Homes – Experience harmony and positivity in vastu-compliant residences at ASMI Legacy.  \n  \nAmple Car Parking – Dedicated car parking spaces for residents and visitors.  \n  \nIntercom Facility – Stay connected with an intercom facility available in each apartment.  \n  \nPower Backup – Enjoy uninterrupted living with 24/7 power backup for all essential services.  \n  \nFire Safety Systems – ASMI Legacy is equipped with modern fire safety systems for residents' protection.  \n  \nWi-Fi Connectivity – Seamless Wi-Fi connectivity available in common areas. [...] Modern Gymnasium – Stay fit at the fully equipped gym at ASMI Legacy, offering state-of-the-art fitness equipment.  \n  \nChildren's Play Area – Safe and fun play area for children at ASMI Legacy in Goregaon West.  \n  \nLandscaped Garden – Relax and unwind in the beautifully landscaped garden spaces.  \n  \nMultipurpose Hall – Host parties or events at the multipurpose hall available to residents.  \n  \nJogging Track – ASMI Legacy offers a dedicated jogging track for fitness enthusiasts.  \n  \nYoga Deck – Practice yoga in a serene environment with the specially designed yoga deck.  \n  \n24/7 Security with CCTV – Advanced security features, including 24/7 CCTV surveillance, ensure safety.  \n  \nIndoor Games Room – Engage in fun activities with family and friends in the indoor games room.","score":0.81524754,"raw_content":null,"id":"2af73d-06"},{"url":"https://www.addressofchoice.com/asmi-legacy-goregaon-west-mumbai-p70930","title":"Asmi Legacy in Goregaon West, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price","content":"Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Multipurpose","score":0.78963995,"raw_content":null,"id":"f78f29-07"}],"response_time":3.65,"request_id":"2b087d8f-d62e-495c-ab61-b09888ac85a6"}